{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37717","headline":"阙下春日 · 郑谷","name":"阙下春日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建章宫殿紫云飘，春漏迟迟下绦霄。\n绮陌暖风嘶去马，粉廊初日照趋朝。\n花经宿雨香难拾，莺在豪家语更娇。\n秦楚年年有离别，扬鞭挥袖灞陵桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}